{"reviews":[{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-0","r":5.0,"t":"Love the colors!","x":"I am not a professional,  but we have to keep in mind that this is only the gel color; the quality,  lasting,  shine,  and durability depends on the base and coat that you use. In the picture you can see two of the colors in the set. I love them,  I tried a third color in my toenails,  looks different from the color on the bottle, but it still looks good. I am satisfied with it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-1","r":5.0,"t":"Exactly as described","x":"I wanted to try gel Polish at home. I have a dryer and a few colors but I was interested in expanding my color selections with a few summer fun colors. This set fit the bill. So far I have had the Polish on 1.5 weeks and I am at the beach!  It has held up to sand and surf. This is the pretty glitter shade.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-2","r":2.0,"t":"Esperaba mas calidad","x":"Compre este producto a un buen precio, pero ya saben... la calidad no es muy buena, las u\u00f1as no me duraron pintadas ni 1 d\u00eda. No vuelvo a comprar.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-3","r":5.0,"t":"Really nice polish set","x":"Really nice set of polish. After one week of wear no chips in sight. I usually have at least one chip by now. Happy with this purchase.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-4","r":5.0,"t":"Long lasting","x":"Product was easy to work with, and also, this picture was taken on day 6 of wear, and it's still holding up well.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"I love the colors of this set of polish and i will be buying more colors soon. Thanks for making a great product","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-6","r":5.0,"t":"Get them!","x":"I like how quickly the product arrived. Not only did it arrive fast, but the packaging was really good. I have been using this for a couple of weeks now and I've been able to try two to three colors. They are super pigmented, didn't required too many coats to look good, cured really fast and stayed on for quite a good minute.  I've been trying to wear my real nails for a while now and haven't been able to find a good gel that stays on and looks nice. However, this one is really good","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-7","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty colors","x":"Don\u2019t mind my dry hands - gel polish has been on over a week, 1 thumb peeled off but I think I didn\u2019t file /prep it well. First time trying gel polish by myself and it was easy - got the beetles brand base and top coat to use with these. And ordered a Uv light that worked great. Total for everything was about $30 - I normally pay $120 with tip a month for my nails. Hopefully this lasts and saves me long term","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-8","r":5.0,"t":"Nice gel polish","x":"I didn\u2019t expect #01 to look like melted chocolate. So here are my samples so you can see the true colors. Samples are painted with two coats of color each. #04 will need more than 2 coats to accomplish the color shown by seller. So far so good though. They applied nicely and smoothly.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-9","r":2.0,"t":"Color is not as advertised","x":"The colors aren't bad but they do not look like what was advertised in the photo swatches. The bottles aren't even all the same color as what was in the picture. The polish is good quality but I'm going to buy a set from a different brand to get the colors I actually wanted","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-10","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful pastel colors","x":"This set is cute. Is just pastel colors which I like, the battle is small and as you can see in the picture I made my nails with that , I use the UV light to cure it and also I use base and top coat. Simple and beautiful.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-11","r":4.0,"t":"Nice product overall","x":"I like the product. Super easy to use and works pretty well. My only complaint is that the bottle is not a very good representation of the color of the actual gel ones you apply it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-12","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty Color","x":"The colors are so pretty and it goes on well. It was easy to use and appears to wear well with everyday activities. Will buy other colors from this vendor if possible.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-13","r":4.0,"t":"Not as bright or differentiation of colors as you\u2019re thinking.","x":"I was thinking the colors would be more bright, or pigmented but not as much so as in the photos. Still really pretty, just super neutral.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-14","r":5.0,"t":"Good","x":"The colors are so pretty! Perfect for holidays. It's easy to apply evenly, looks glossy when finished and lasts long time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-15","r":1.0,"t":"color doesn\u2019t stay long","x":"the colors turn out nice and look exactly like advertised!  **update:  sadly it doesn\u2019t last long and chipped easily \u2026","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-16","r":2.0,"t":"Didn\u2019t get colors shown!","x":"The colors shown are not close to what I received.  The polish in the \u201cred\u201d bottle is really just sparkles. \ud83d\ude33","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-17","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful colors","x":"This polish is great! It looks pretty and goes on so smooth. I will definitely be trying out more colors!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-18","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Product!","x":"Love the shades and the polish last a long time! Excellent quality and excellent price! Highly recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-19","r":1.0,"t":"Awful","x":"Bubbles up, chips way too easily! I\u2019ve done my own nails at home for years and this was the worst set","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-20","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful colors!","x":"This is a great variety pack of gel nail polish. Beautiful colors and can\u2019t wait to try them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-21","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"Love the colors drys pretty fast definetly would purchase this brand again thank you!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-22","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"Love the colors drys pretty fast definetly would purchase this brand again thank you!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love the Colors","x":"This polish is great! I Love the colors and it stayed on for almost 2 weeks!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B0BXNQZW5C-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great!","x":"Super easy to paint with, cute colors, and good quality for the price!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the colors as pretty and love the set's shades.","cites":[1,6,11,13,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers report the polish is long-lasting and holds up well over a week or more without chipping.","cites":[2,4,5,8,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the polish is easy to apply and works well, especially with a base and top coat and UV light.","cites":[7,8,9,11,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the actual colors don't match the advertised photos or bottle swatches.","cites":[10,12,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers report poor durability or quality, with polish not lasting even a day.","cites":[3]}]},"qa":[]}